      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹135 (vs ₹118 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹135 (up from ₹118 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.64b (up 9.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.54b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 27% (up from 26% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 12% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
